WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.280
At Innovex, we understand
that care starts with people.

2
00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:09.520
When a resident develops symptoms,
early detection is essential.

3
00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.080
Danger might extend beyond one room.

4
00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:17.540
Knowing which pathogens may be involved
helps guide what comes next.

5
00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:22.300
Our molecular PCR testing looks for pathogens
and selected antibiotic resistance genes

6
00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.700
directly from the specimen.

7
00:00:24.700 --> 00:00:28.020
Rapid results equates to a rapid response.

8
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:31.340
For incontinent residents who cannot
provide clean-catch urine,

9
00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.580
Innovex offers brief-based specimen collection.

10
00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:39.660
Bring Innovex molecular testing to your facility
while keeping your current lab.

11
00:00:39.660 --> 00:00:44.300
Onboarding and initial collection supplies
are provided at no cost.

12
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.660
Let’s start with one panel for a clinical need
your team sees every day.

13
00:00:48.660 --> 00:00:52.500
InnovexLab: building the future of diagnostics.

14
00:00:58.020 --> 00:01:02.020
www.InnovexLab.com
